OL,3,GNEWSAAsda offices evacuated due to
OL,4,A'suspicious package'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsda's head office building has been
OL,7,Fevacuated after a "suspicious package"
OL,8,Fwas discovered.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police received reports
OL,11,Fof the item having been sent to Asda
OL,12,FHouse, on Great Wilson Street in Leeds,
OL,13,Fat about 11:15 GMT on Monday.
OL,15,FAn Army Explosive Ordnance Disposal
OL,16,Fteam attended the scene and carried out
OL,17,Fa controlled explosion on the package.
OL,19,FEmergency services remain at the scene,
OL,20,Fwith roads around the building expected
OL,21,Fto be closed throughout rush hour on
OL,22,FMonday evening.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
